---

8. Knowledge Graph

The Knowledge Graph is the central data model.

Everything discovered by Ohira becomes interconnected entities.

Example:

Project
│
├── Framework
├── Routes
├── APIs
├── Database
├── Models
├── Services
├── Containers
├── Environment
└── Documentation

Relationships enable advanced queries such as:

Which APIs use this model?

Which routes require authentication?

Which services depend on Redis?

Which Docker service exposes this API?



