Plugin Architecture

Each plugin implements a common interface.

interface OhiraPlugin {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  version: string;

  supports(project: Project): boolean;

  analyze(context: AnalysisContext): Promise<KnowledgeNode[]>;
}

This ensures consistency across all integrations.


